{
  "title": { "zh": "0 加在右边" },
  "fact": "addZero",
  "showcase": {
    "zh": "归纳规则的结论是 ∀x. ?P(x)：倒着用，?P 从目标里读出来，两条前提就是两个目标；第二个目标的已知里，正是对 x 成立的那一句"
  },
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "加法的定义只拆左边的数。0 加在右边，具体的数好算；要对所有 x 成立，就要用声明给的最后一条规则：<wiki-ref to=\"induction\"></wiki-ref>。"
      }
    }
  ],
  "after": {
    "zh": "x + 0 = x 进了「数理规则书」：证出的等式既是规则，也是化简的改写规则。"
  },
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "in-zero_1",
      "kind": "machine",
      "tray": "machine",
      "want": "proved",
      "inputs": [{ "name": "in", "label": { "zh": "目标" } }],
      "backtrack": true,
      "words": ["everyday", "terms"],
      "step": { "zh": "算具体的数" },
      "types": ["nat"],
      "defs": ["plus"],
      "tests": [
        { "goal": "plus(s(s(zero)), zero) = s(s(zero))" },
        { "goal": "plus(s(s(s(zero))), zero) = s(s(s(zero)))" }
      ],
      "brief": { "zh": "设计一个证明助手，证完每一个目标。" },
      "hint": [{ "zh": "化简就够了。" }],
      "solution": [
        "c0r0 = math[use=[\"def.0\", \"def.1\"]]()",
        "c1r0 = refl()",
        "c0 = simp(in, c0r0)",
        "c1 = rule(c0, c1r0)",
        "out <- c1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "in-zero_2",
      "kind": "proof",
      "tray": "proof",
      "step": { "zh": "在证明板上" },
      "adds": ["natInd"],
      "consts": ["zero"],
      "words": ["everyday", "terms"],
      "cases": [],
      "tests": [
        {
          "premises": { "d0": "∀y. plus(zero, y) = y", "d1": "∀x. ∀y. plus(s(x), y) = s(plus(x, y))" },
          "goal": "∀x. plus(x, zero) = x"
        }
      ],
      "brief": {
        "zh": "从加法的两条定义证出：对所有 x，x + 0 = x。"
      },
      "hint": [
        { "zh": "0 的情况只用第一条定义。" },
        {
          "zh": "从 a 到 S a：第二条定义算出 S a + 0 = S (a + 0)，框里还有一句假设。"
        }
      ],
      "intro": [
        {
          "t": {
            "zh": "新元件「数学归纳法」：在元件上选要证的「对所有 x」。它有两个框：第一个框证 0 的情况；第二个框里有一个数 a，假设句子对 a 成立，证它对 S a 也成立。"
          }
        }
      ],
      "solution": [
        "n = natInd[P=\"forall x. plus(x, zero) = x\", x=a](zero: z, step: w) {",
        "  zero {",
        "    z = allE[t=zero](d0)",
        "  }",
        "  step {",
        "    s1 = allE[t=a](d1)",
        "    s2 = allE[t=zero](s1)",
        "    w = rewrite[at=[0]](n.step, s2)",
        "  }",
        "}",
        "goal <- n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "in-zero_3",
      "kind": "machine",
      "tray": "machine",
      "want": "proved",
      "inputs": [{ "name": "in", "label": { "zh": "目标" } }],
      "backtrack": true,
      "words": ["everyday", "terms"],
      "step": { "zh": "对所有 x" },
      "types": ["nat"],
      "defs": ["plus"],
      "tests": [{ "goal": "∀x. plus(x, zero) = x" }],
      "intro": [
        {
          "t": {
            "zh": "化简改不动 x + 0：不知道 x 是 0 还是 S 什么。声明给的归纳规则和两个框的元件做的是同一件事：⟦?P(0); ⋀x. ?P(x) ⟹ ?P(S x)⟧ ⟹ ∀x. ?P(x)。"
          }
        }
      ],
      "brief": { "zh": "证明对所有 x，x + 0 = x。" },
      "hint": [
        {
          "zh": "归纳规则的结论是 ∀x. ?P(x)，可以倒着用。"
        },
        { "zh": "第二个目标的已知里有一句等式。" }
      ],
      "solution": [
        "c0r0 = math[use=[\"nat.induct\"]]()",
        "c0 = rule(in, c0r0)",
        "c1 = each(c0, body: c3) {",
        "  body {",
        "    c2r0 = math[use=[\"def.0\", \"def.1\"]]()",
        "    c3r0 = refl()",
        "    c2r2 = hyp(c2r0)",
        "    c2 = simp(c1.body, c2r2)",
        "    c3 = rule(c2, c3r0)",
        "  }",
        "}",
        "out <- c1"
      ],
      "naive": [
        "c0r0 = math[use=[\"def.0\", \"def.1\"]]()",
        "c1r0 = refl()",
        "c0 = simp(in, c0r0)",
        "c1 = rule(c0, c1r0)",
        "out <- c1"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
